 "caption": "Find it on Cancha: Weston FC 🩵\n\nBroward club with boys' and girls' programs. SoccerWire's Top 100 has them as the top-ranked club in Florida: #14 in the U.S. for boys, #46 for girls (as published by the club).\n\nGirls' pathway: SFPL → NPL → DPL → college. Boys: youth teams, MLS NEXT, and adult UPSL and League Two teams.\n\nThanksgiving camp: Nov 23–25 at Vista Park. Details and sign-up on the club's site.\n\nFind Weston FC and more South Florida clubs on Cancha. Link in bio.\n#westonfc #browardsoccer #floridasoccer #youthsoccer",
